202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The objective of this investigation was to determine the violation of the constitutional rights of legal security, due process, work, formal equality, and non-discrimination towards police officers in the qualification process for promotion to the next higher grade within the National Police of Ecuador. It was a mixed, documentary and field study, using legal hermeneutic and analytical-synthetic methods.)
/E (The objective of this investigation was to determine the violation of the constitutional rights of legal security, due process, work, formal equality, and non-discrimination towards police officers in the qualification process for promotion to the next higher grade within the National Police of Ecuador. It was a mixed, documentary and field study, using legal hermeneutic and analytical-synthetic methods.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
